<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-057-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.300359" lon="-120.915669"><name>SC26-057-C</name><cmt>SC26-057</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 41/100; not catch probability. Center 155 ft; nearby 151–166 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-040</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.302310153225655" lon="-120.91644400342066"/><trkpt lat="35.30142609789036" lon="-120.91745638402728"/><trkpt lat="35.300436779156605" lon="-120.91759170889709"/><trkpt lat="35.30059995507745" lon="-120.9165978283388"/><trkpt lat="35.300235725748635" lon="-120.9163872361829"/><trkpt lat="35.299606849065796" lon="-120.9165133286249"/><trkpt lat="35.29959927101596" lon="-120.9160736625472"/><trkpt lat="35.29932515101617" lon="-120.91586076377298"/><trkpt lat="35.29958221456524" lon="-120.91508441447249"/><trkpt lat="35.299388722774566" lon="-120.91431962609752"/><trkpt lat="35.30010960303224" lon="-120.9143011209729"/><trkpt lat="35.30055636018947" lon="-120.91406971961025"/><trkpt lat="35.30058669265733" lon="-120.91582840336854"/><trkpt lat="35.30094713307307" lon="-120.91581915716937"/><trkpt lat="35.3009547122